id: party-tactics
name: Party Tactics
talentCategory: racial
race: konatsian
prerequisites: Konatsian, 2+ Teamwork Talents
description: >
  Supporting other members of your group is one of your most important roles.
text: >
  Party Tactics: Supporting other members of your group is one of your most important roles.
  –Prerequisites: Konatsian, 2+ Teamwork Talents
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Combat Rolls of all Allies within a Minor Sphere AoE (centered on you) by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally uses an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Tension to apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally is targeted by an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Tension to increase that Ally’s Damage Reduction by 3(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Minor Sphere centred on you - the Squares beside you: an Ally's Strike, Dodge and Wound Rolls 1(T), yours (chat.mjs partyParts).
allow party.rolls;
# (2), (3) Buttons on the attack's card till its Wound Roll is made, for whoever plays you - a stack of Tension each, once a Round
# each: an Ally's attack, an Energy Charge; an Ally aimed at, their Damage Reduction 3(T) against it (chat.mjs partyButtons).
allow party.charge;
allow party.reduction;
